  "body": "For more information, please download the property files within the link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/UX12\r\n\r\nAuction Thursday 3rd December from 12pm (Unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and elevated to capture views out to the ocean, this character-filled home combines the warmth of natural timber with stylish modern finishes and a relaxed coastal setting. Exposed timber beams and polished timber flooring feature throughout the spacious open-plan living areas, complemented by a separate lounge and large stacker doors opening onto private wrap-around decking, established gardens and a dedicated spa area. Four double bedrooms are spread across two levels, including a substantial master retreat enjoying ocean views, a walk-through wardrobe and a beautifully finished ensuite with a freestanding bath and fully tiled shower.\r\n\r\n* Exposed timber features plus polished timber flooring throughout\r\n* Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living plus separate lounge\r\n* Stylish kitchen with gas cooking and excellent bench space\r\n* Four bedrooms plus family bathroom with built-in bath and stylish barn doors\r\n* Large upstairs master retreat with ocean views, walk-through wardrobe and fully tiled ensuite\r\n* Dedicated upstairs study or work-from-home nook\r\n* Private wrap-around decking with stacker doors and dedicated spa area\r\n* Established native trees, landscaped gardens and lawn space\r\n* Wood-burning fireplace, plus heat pumps and double glazing\r\n* Double garage with additional off-street parking\r\n\r\nPositioned close to Arkles Beach, with Stanmore Bay Beach, local schools, shops and everyday amenities all within easy reach, the location offers plenty to enjoy along the Hibiscus Coast.  The owners are keen to make their next move and welcome your interest. Get in touch to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nWe work with all agents from day one.",
